    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify; font-size: 10pt"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><B>$154.7 Million PIPE Financing Closed:</B> Zhibao Technology Inc. (NASDAQ: ZBAO) (&ldquo;Zhibao,&rdquo; &ldquo;we,&rdquo; or the &ldquo;Company&rdquo;) has closed its previously announced private investment in public equity (&ldquo;PIPE&rdquo;) financing for an aggregate purchase price of $154,700,000.</FONT></TD></TR>
