    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify; font-size: 10pt"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><B>Streamlined Unit Structure:</B> The transaction comprises 442,000,000 PIPE Units at $0.35 per Unit (each consisting of one Class A Ordinary Share and one two-year Warrant exercisable at $0.35 per share), with 395,678,152 Units delivered at closing and the remaining 46,321,848 Units to be delivered following shareholder approval.</FONT></TD></TR>
